shairport-sync: don't require libavformat

shairport-sync includes <libavformat/avformat.h> but calls no libavformat
function: it decodes with libavcodec and resamples with libswresample. Dropping
the include and the configure check lets it build against an FFmpeg that has
only the decoders it needs.
Applies to shairport-sync 0a34fbda83724cc06266aadcf7c88acc8fef4e7d (5.6.2),
after shairport-sync-libgcrypt.patch.

